# Small hardening fixes.
#   * protocol.h, networkmessage.h: the XTEA key of a Protocol and the NetworkMessage buffer start zeroed instead of
#     holding whatever the allocation contained (no uninitialised bytes reach the network or the cipher).
#   * globalevent.cpp, luascript.cpp, globalevent.h: a globalevent time ("hh", "hh:mm", "hh:mm:ss" in globalevents.xml
#     or globalevent:time()) that is empty, not a number or has too many parts was an uncaught exception
#     (vectorAtoi / params.front()) that aborted the server at startup or reload; a failing localtime() was a null
#     dereference. Both places now use one parser, parseGlobalEventTime, that prints the error and rejects the event.
# Apply in the server source root after 0006: patch -p1 < 0007-hardening-fixes.patch, then rebuild.
--- a/src/globalevent.cpp
